          Digital interfaces and websites for startups and small brands.
        </h1>
        <p class="hero__lead">
          Custom-designed and precision-engineered across the platforms and
          systems your business is already familiar with.
        </p>
        <a class="hero__cta button--emphasis" href="#services">View services</a>
        <BlenderLogo />
      </section>
      <section id="services" class="layout-wide">
        <h2>H2 heading placeholder</h2>
        <div class="service-register">
